{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken","id":173302,"title":"Just Bruised - Broken?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-18T16:31:56-07:00","id":173302,"title":"Just Bruised - Broken?","content":"The guys at my table are convinced that &quot;just bruised&quot; is far too useful to be an embed. They used the word broken a lot and said that it should have been an exploit. One even went as far as to say it should cost willpower on top of a point of aether. It seems to me that &quot;just bruised&quot; fits just fine with the other embeds in terms of power. Have any of you had trouble with this embed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3323,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","user":"cmwatford","date":". 06-18-2014, 08:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T16:51:35-07:00","id":173335,"title":"","content":"oh christ not this shit again<br /> <br /> The Embed does nothing to mitigate the <i>type</i> of damage suffered, it gets harder to use every time you use it, and Embed or no, there are some things that are going to break your Cover to do in front of witnesses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:03:50-07:00","id":173348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken?p=173335#post173335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh christ not this shit again<br /> <br /> The Embed does nothing to mitigate the <i>type</i> of damage suffered, it gets harder to use every time you use it, and Embed or no, there are some things that are going to break your Cover to do in front of witnesses.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I agree wholeheartedly. They seem to have issue with the idea that you can nearly completely mitigate damage for free. Apparantly the diminishing number of uses and potential for compromise isn't enough for them. I tried to explain that it makes up for not having a risk free means of healing mid battle but they weren't buying it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:04:45-07:00","id":173350,"title":"","content":"That's really on them, then. If they use it and try to be broken with it, then show them the consequences of doing so. If they don't take it, then it isn't a problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T09:01:42-07:00","id":175275,"title":"","content":"There's also the fact that it's only useful in combat, which is a highly fluid situation...but really just one possible situation. Are they being fighty <i>all the time</i>? Then it's a really useful power. Are they getting into fights once every few sessions? Then it's useful, but not as. <br /> <br /> But my actual play experience is that it's a useful Embed, but not overly so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T10:31:26-07:00","id":175371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken?p=175275#post175275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's also the fact that it's only useful in combat, which is a highly fluid situation...but really just one possible situation. Are they being fighty <i>all the time</i>? Then it's a really useful power. Are they getting into fights once every few sessions? Then it's useful, but not as.<br /> <br /> But my actual play experience is that it's a useful Embed, but not overly so.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thankfully it seems my group is coming around after a bit more reading and thought. However, I feel the need to challenge the idea that the embed is only useful in combat. I can think of several non combat situations where being able to mitigate damage would be useful. Falling damage, explosions, and environmental damage come to mind readily. Am I misunderstanding something about the rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T10:37:19-07:00","id":175374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cmwatford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken?p=175371#post175371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Thankfully it seems my group is coming around after a bit more reading and thought. However, I feel the need to challenge the idea that the embed is only useful in combat. I can think of several non combat situations where being able to mitigate damage would be useful. Falling damage, explosions, and environmental damage come to mind readily. Am I misunderstanding something about the rules?</div> </div> </div> </div>The frequency with which players will encounter a hurricane or a cliff is proportionally tiny relative to the likelihood that someone will attempt to do them harm with fists or weapons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T11:25:29-07:00","id":175421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken?p=175374#post175374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The frequency with which players will encounter a hurricane or a cliff is proportionally tiny relative to the likelihood that someone will attempt to do them harm with fists or weapons.</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured that was what he was getting at but wanted to be sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T06:39:01-07:00","id":176950,"title":"","content":"Right, exactly. <i>Mostly</i> useful in combat, but you're right, useful in any situation in which harm could happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T15:55:36-07:00","id":177399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173302-just-bruised-broken?p=176950#post176950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right, exactly. <i>Mostly</i> useful in combat, but you're right, useful in any situation in which harm could happen.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Glad to have that clarified. My head is now full of scenes of demons jumping off buildings to loose pursuers, climbing out of burning wreckage, and generally being as stubbornly alive as the T-1000. I will have much fun with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T05:55:18-07:00","id":177862,"title":"","content":"Also, if your opponent is doing something, like, oh, Merciless Gunman, or using a damage Gadget, then go ahead and call for Clash of Wills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}